window.products.push({"id":696052,"name":"Happy Mothers Day Banner,Aobkiat Mothers Day Decorations Set,Hanging Backdrop Garland for Mother Birthday,Home Party,Baby Shower,Floral Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k3MnCh+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mother's Day Gift: The pack contains 5 Mother's Day decorative cards in different designs that can be strung together. Printed with beautiful pink flowers, the gold butterflies add to the sophistication of this little ornament, perfect for Mother's Day, hanging at home or at a party to show your love Durable Material: The high quality material makes our mum decoration reusable, you can use it not only on Mother's Day but also on her birthday Practical: These happy Mother's Day decorations can be applied for Mother's Day or as a gift for a friend who is a first-time mother. With any type of celebration for mum, they can be used as a present to apply directly, or hung in windows, plants, gift boxes, doors, mantels, bookshelves and wherever else decorations can be hung to give her a ritual surprise Easy to Assemble: This mothers day decorations banner are PRE-STRUNG,you simply glue the gold paper butterflies to the card , then hang the flags on hooks on the wall , for outdoor parties hang them on branches in the backyard and it turns them into a beautiful backdrop With Love: Our Mother's Day decorations banners will add a wonderful ambience and a special touch of love to your mother's party. Sincerely wishing every mother to be happy, young, beautiful and healthy forever, give her your best wishes with our mum banners","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k3MnCh+xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aobkiat","source_asin":"B0BZ7GJKQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ7GJKQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ7GJKQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696053,"name":"Minnesota Rectangle Notary Stamp -MN Official Notary Stamp - Enter Custom Text","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4123vi42AzL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our notary stamps are ideal for new or renewing notaries public. We offer custom options that make creating your own notary stamp quick and easy. Each notary stamp is made to meet your state’s standards. State requirements vary on text, ink color, emblem design, and more. Based on the state you practice in, you may need to include information like your name, license number, and expiration date on your impression. Our stamps come pre-assembled, so you will be ready to notarize documents as soon as you receive your order! Why shop 904 Custom? We provide easy custom options in our listing, so you don’t have to wait to hear back from us after you order! Simply click “customize now” and add in your state specified information. Once you check out, expect your personalized notary stamp in 1-2 business days! It’s that easy. What is a Self-Inking Stamp? Self-inking stamps have an internal ink pad. With each impression the design is pressed up against the ink pad and then flipped back down to leave a quality impression on your paper. This mechanism makes self-inking stamps perfect for rapid stamping, allowing you to easily imprint large piles of paperwork in minutes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4123vi42AzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"904 Custom","source_asin":"B07SQBHMGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQBHMGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQBHMGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
