window.products.push({"id":696157,"name":"AziPro Garment Steamer for Clothes, Handheld Clothes Steamer Anti-Drip, Powerful Wrinkle Remover for Home and Travel for Vertical & Horizontal Ironing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETjIGhY5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Most people don’t like to do housework, you do it because you have to do it. For washing you have washing machines, but you still need to iron the clothes by yourself. The the traditional iron is so heavy to hold and after you finished ironing all the clothes, you get arm pain. But now you have the new thing, our travel steamer can help you make everything easier and it makes a big difference. 💎 How to use? Step 1: Adjust the temperature dial to the max Step 2: Full the water tank within 100ml(80ml Suggestion) Step 3: Plug the power cord Step 4: Adjust the temperature dial and wait the light become red Step 5: Keep push the button and get the steam 💎 Warning: Keep away from kids. Please don’t work on the same area for a long time to avoid damaging your clothes. if possible, you can put a piece of thin cloth above your fabric for protection. When the LED indicator is red, DON'T press the release button in case of leaking water. When you add some water into the tank, make sure you turn off the switch in case of leaking water. When you finish the outfit, let it stop working 5 minutes. 💎 Specification: Power: 800W Voltage: 110V Material: ABS Item weight: 1.1KG Length of cord: 5.1 ft/155cm Water tank capacity: 100ml(80ml we suggested) Continuous Steaming time: 15 minutes 💎 Package Included: 1x Steamer Iron 1x Linen brush 1x Bristle brush 1x Measuring cup 1x Safety stand 1x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETjIGhY5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AziPro","source_asin":"B07QWWQDTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QWWQDTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QWWQDTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
