window.products.push({"id":696179,"name":"Mayfair Linen Luxury 800-Thread-Count 100% Cotton Sheets, Damask Stripe White Color Full Size Set for Hot Sleepers, Sateen Weave for Soft Feel, Fits M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rXOMCC+1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔NOT ALL COTTON SHEET SETS ARE CREATED EQUAL: Some are 30% thicker than average sheets, made from extra long staple cotton for improved softness and durability, and then 2x mercerized for a glossy sheen and silky touch. Yes, we are talking about our Egyptian cotton quality 800 thread count cotton striped sheets set. These hotel collection damask sheets are heavyweight yet thick, cozy yet crisp, breathable and cool, for the best sleep ever ✔THE BEST FIT FOR FULL-SIZE DEEP POCKET MATTRESS: Our white stripe fitted sheets have extra deep pockets to fit adjustable mattresses up to 18 inches deep, and all-around elastic for a snug fit. Smart tags indicate the ‘length’ and ‘breadth’ sides to make the bed, and standard closures keep the pillows inside the cover. The 4-piece full size damask sheet set includes 1 Flat Sheet (81’’ W x 96’’ L), 1 Fitted or Bottom Sheet (54” W x 75” L + 16” deep pocket), and 2 Standard/Queen Pillowcases (21” W x 32” L) ✔100% ECO-FRIENDLY COTTON SHEETS FOR YOUR SAFETY: We source pure cotton that is grown naturally without chemicals, synthetics, and GMOs. Cotton is eco-friendly, keeps you cool and light, and is better for the environment, unlike microfiber and other linens. Plus, our STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certification is a guarantee that our damask sheets full size are free from textile chemicals and harmful dyes, making them safe for you and the kids at house ✔MAINTENANCE AS EASY AS 1-2-3: Made from the highest quality dyes, our top-rated 800 count sheets full sheets are machine washable and don’t fade on the wash. They are also resistant to pilling and shrinking. The best part? These cotton bed sheets open up in a few washes and become softer. We recommend washing our full size sheet sets damask once a week and tumble drying on low mode. ✔DON’T LIKE OUR COTTON SHEETS? GET YOUR MONEY BACK: If you don’t like our white damask bedding, get them exchanged/refunded within 30 days of purchase as per Amazon guidelines. Make your Christmas, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, weddings, vacation, and autumn holidays special with these cooling sheets. Give them as a gift or pair them with a luxury comforter, duvet cover, and other bedroom decors for the best sleep ever","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rXOMCC+1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayfair Linen","source_asin":"B07RGKWXSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RGKWXSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RGKWXSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
