window.products.push({"id":696282,"name":"Chardin home Coral Pink Crochet Bathrug,100% Cotton Round bathmat with artisanally Handcrafted Crochet Border, 24 Inch Diameter, Perfect for Half Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91V0fJzzdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% NATURAL COTTON- Step onto plush, spa-like softness with Chardin Home’s all natural, cotton bath mats, styled especially to protect your feet from cold bathroom floors after a shower, but also to protect your floors from moisture and grime. HAND STITCHED CROCHET LACE - Get yourself a Bath Mat that is not only practical to use but also beautifully stylish with a handcrafted vintage crochet border. Since the intricate lace border is handmade in the cottage industries by local artisans, there might be a slight deviation from the pictured rug. SKID RESISTANCE- You do not have to worry about a bath rug that slips and slides everywhere because this comfortable bathmat has been sprayed with all natural latex to improve bathrug grip on slick floors and stop the rug from slipping and sliding around too much. QUICK DRYING- The superior quality cotton yarns wick away water and moisture leaving your bath room dry and usable. Not only is this bath mat highly absorptive but it also dries quicker, protecting your floors from bath water and moisture. VERSATILE USE- Elevate your home decor with Chardin Home’s elegant and fashionable bath rugs that are available in a wide variety of colors and sizes. Also feel free to use these as throw rugs in other areas of your home as well. Perfect for your kitchen, entryway, hallways, bedrooms and anywhere else your heart desires. These soft rugs are also perfect for children’s rooms, baby rooms and nurseries. SOFT & COZY- With a pile height of ½ inch, these enchanting bathroom rugs are not only soft to touch but have a pleasant and welcoming deluxe hotel spa-like feeling every time you walk out of your shower or bath. Perfect size for usage by the sink, bathtub or shower stalls and even small half baths or powder rooms EASY CARE- You can machine wash these bath mats SEPARATELY, IN COLD WATER. Always use a MILD SOAP and DO NOT BLEACH. You can TUMBLE DRY on LOW, and remove rug from dryer and shake well when almost dry to prolong life of the rug. DURABLE- These rugs are made with superior quality cotton yarns that are strong and durable. Cotton being a natural fiber will lint in the first few washes; however, with each wash the yarns become stronger & super absorbent. AESTHETIC- Transform your bathroom, half bath or powder room into an oasis of comfort and style. From shabby chic, retro French Country bathroom mats to bohemian farmhouse bathrugs to mid-century modern and contemporary designs, find rugs that fit your style and decor perfectly. GREAT GIFT- Great gift idea for all occasions, housewarming, Christmas, Wedding, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, Valentines, Birthdays, Back to school & more. Great for your home aesthetic for any barbecues, dinner parties, other special occasions or even for everyday use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91V0fJzzdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chardin home","source_asin":"B07VPTG3LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VPTG3LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VPTG3LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
