window.products.push({"id":696287,"name":"Tezzorio (Set of 6) Stainless Steel Mixing Bowl Set, 3/4-1 1/2-3-4-5-8 Quart, Polished Mirror Finish Nesting Flat Base Bowls, Commercial Mixing Bowls ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+P3VX6xxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mix, toss, and prep like a pro! This incredible set is a must when baking or kitchen prepping for your multiple dishes. Discover a timeless classic set of mixing bowls that serve for a vast assortment of purposes in food preparation. These high-rimmed bowls can help users perform a variety of kitchen duties, from cracking eggs to mixing batter. They are made from high- quality stainless steel that resists scratches and bumps and provides a shiny finish that lasts and lasts for years. The bowl is refrigerator and freezer safe which makes it ideal for submerged marinating of meat, prepping meats or preparing salads for later. Wash the bowl easily in the dishwasher or wash them by hand. Our bowls were designed to make meals preparing a breeze. A wide rolled rim ensures a seamless pour every time with fewer spills when pouring batters. It allows you to have a sturdy grip whenever handling the bowl. These bowls feature a flat bottom which is especially convenient for mixing and beating. From mixing, tossing, and whisking to prepping and serving; these bowls are sure to be a kitchen staple. Why food-grade stainless steel? Aluminum is much softer than stainless steel, so can dent, ding or scratch easily. Cheap plastic imitations absorb odor, and can easily stain and warp over time. Unlike wood or plastic, stainless steel does not absorb bacteria or odors ensuring food tastes fresh and crisp every single time. Premium food-grade stainless steel is the only material designed to be extremely durable, safe to use, and built to last a lifetime. If you love making and serving delicious foods and are looking for a perfect gadget to make your life easy, then search no further just click on Add to Cart Now to bring this essential tool to your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+P3VX6xxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B074L77JM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074L77JM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074L77JM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
