window.products.push({"id":696310,"name":"Twin Size - Solid Oak Wooden Platform Bed Frame-Beautiful Hand-Rubbed Linseed Oil Finish-Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cARrIP2JL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for strength, elegance and affordability in a platform bed then you have found it! This sleek, yet solid design is simply a great bed at a great price. Made with sustainable Pennsylvania Red Oak, this bed represents one the very best values in platform bed frames anywhere on the market. That's because our solid oak wood platform beds are designed to be simple and attractive; yet very affordable and strong beyond comparison. Our Beautiful Hand Rubbed Linseed Oil Finish serves as a conditioner for the wood and will no doubt serve you well for many years. Its clear color will not change the natural color of the wood or the grain, but it will enhance both as it ages, to produce that rich aged look we all appreciate. Because the oil fills the pores of the wood, finger prints and day to day dirt are less likely to be absorbed into the wood in comparison to unfinished wood. NOTE: Linseed Oil is NOT the same as a Lacquered/Glossy Finish; instead it is oil that leaves a slightly silky feel to natural untreated wood. Like all platform beds, this frame does not require the use of a foundation or box spring. We use Southern Yellow Pine bed slats for their strength to create a solid platform for your mattress while this also allows room for good air circulation. Outside bed height is 15 Inches while the actual platform height is slightly less (your mattress or futon will drop into a recessed area, allowing for approximately a .25 inch lip to surround your mattress). Under-bed clearance is 10.5 Inches below the rail, so lots of storage space! Under bed storage drawers are available and sold separately. This bed comes ready-to-assemble, and assembly is so easy! There are no tools required; the (2) hex wrenches you need for assembly are included. As with all of our solid wood, American-made furniture, you also get a 10 Year Warranty. *Naturally Beautiful HAND MADE IN USA *MATERIAL: Premium Oak *Overall Dimensions: 39 7/8\" W x 78\" L x 15\" H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cARrIP2JL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Room Doctor Platform Beds","source_asin":"B0009X06A2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009X06A2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009X06A2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
