window.products.push({"id":696332,"name":"Farmhouse Utensil Holder by Brighter Barns - Large Cooking Utensil Organizer - Kitchen Utensil Holder for Countertop - White Utensil Crock - Cute Mode","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZY1mFF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER CUTE FARMHOUSE STYLE - Keep your countertop organized and utensils within reach with this charming & cute farmhouse kitchen utensil organizer. This kitchen utensils holder is both practical and decorative, it fits perfectly with any modern farmhouse decor or other cute kitchen design accessories. THE PERFECT SIZE - This large utensil holder for countertop is the ideal size for any kitchen countertop. It is generously sized to fit all of your utensils without taking too much precious countertop space. The white kitchen utensil holder works perfectly with any cookware tools, mixing spoons, wooden or bamboo utensils. IDEAL GIFT FOR FARMHOUSE LOVERS - Brighten your own home or bring joy to a loved one with the perfect gift! This kitchen utensil caddy for countertop is a great addition to any farmhouse or vintage kitchen décor. The cooking utensil holder white set is perfect for a wedding registry, housewarming or wedding gift! STURDY & BUILT TO LAST - This kitchen utensil holder is crafted from the highest quality carbon steel metal and is built to last. It holds its place and is sturdy. The large utensil organizer is the perfect addition to any home kitchen and compliments any modern farmhouse decor and countertop decor! EASY TO CLEAN - Cleaning this white utensil holder is a breeze! This rustic utensil holder can be washed in the sink or simply wiped down with a damp or soapy cloth, cleaning is a breeze! (Please do *not* use the dishwasher to avoid harming the paint coat)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZY1mFF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brighter Barns","source_asin":"B0965XS8BB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0965XS8BB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0965XS8BB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696333,"name":"SHALOM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712vFdKrvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712vFdKrvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJR9OC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJR9OC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJR9OC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696334,"name":"T-Sac Tea Filter Bags, Disposable Tea Infuser, Number 2-Size, 2 to 4-Cup Capacity, Set of 100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a125GMQWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"T-Sac’s Tea Filter Bags are single-use, natural paper tea infusers for steeping to brew high-quality loose leaf tea with the convenience of tea bags. Enjoy the fresh, natural taste of loose leaf tea without the hassle and mess of conventional straining methods. Control the amount of tea used for a more robust and flavorful cup of tea. Easily blend teas for customized brews. T-Sac Tea Filter Bags are made with fine paper fibers that allow tea to brew quickly while keeping sediment and smaller tea leaves of the finer grade teas from escaping into the brew. The top flap folds over to secure contents inside. The expandable, gusseted bottom allows ample room for tea leaves to fully expand and T-Sac to sit securely without the need for a filter stand. Easy to Use. Simply open the T-Sac, measure in the desired amount of loose leaf tea and fold the top flap over. Place into a teacup for mug and pour in just-boiled water. Steep tea no less than 3 minutes to release its essential oils and maximum the brewed infusion with aroma and flavor. Once tea is steeped to desired strength, discard the T-Sac. Great for steeping all types of tea, including black tea, oolong tea, green tea, chai, chamomile and other herbal tea. Or use for mulling spices for cooking and baking, or make hot apple cider, spiced wine, and other drink recipes with mulled spices. Just fill with aromatic spices instead of loose tea. T-Sac Tea Filter Bags are user friendly and disposable for convenience and easy cleanup. Made in Germany from all-natural, unbleached paper with no chemicals or artificial ingredients to taint the flavor of the tea. Environmentally sensitive, completely biodegradable and fully compostable. Available in 4 convenient sizes to brew tea, from single servings to large teapots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a125GMQWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-Sac","source_asin":"B0745PTB4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0745PTB4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0745PTB4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
