window.products.push({"id":696382,"name":"3PCS Cake Decorating Angled Icing Spatula Set with 6, 8 & 10 Inch Stainless Steel Blade, Wood Handle Offset Frosting Spatulas and 1 Adjustable Cake Le","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xaFaTL3qL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"If you like to bake cakes or cupcakes you should include a professional icing spatula for applying icing or frosting on cakes to your kitchen tools. Our angled icing spatulas are made of premium stainless steel blades with rounded tips and wooden handle. The angle on the handle is terrific and keeps the blade easily off counter surfaces. When icing a cake, it makes quick work of spreading and pushing the icing between cake layers. Icing Spatula Set Features: Offset Handles with Steel Blades, Rust Resistant An offset spatula is ideal for spreading batter in a cake pan or frosting the top of a cake, when you need a little distance from the surface to prevent batter or icing from getting on your knuckles. The long blade makes it easy to smooth cake batter into the corners of a baking pan and loosen the cake from the sides of the pan after it bakes. For larger cakes most bakers like a large offset blade. Multi-purpose - Whether is frosting cupcake, flipping pastries, deserts or any other caking decorating task, this flexible offset spatula set is the perfect frosting tool for all your cake decorating task. Adjustable Cake Cutter Leveler: Adjustable cake leveler with precise scales, you can choose the thickness you want, or you can keep the thickness of the cake layer consistent, making it easy to make layered cakes. The surface of the cake after cutting is smooth and flat, which is good for the beauty of the cake. It can reduce the cake crumb when cutting and is easier to clean. Level and Stack Layered Cake: Purple side adjustments allow you to choose the thickness of each layer. Adjust up or down for custom sizing. Simply slide the leveler through your cake to remove crown and level and torte layers. Stack the cake layers with icing, fruit, pudding or other fillings between to add flavor and height to your cake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xaFaTL3qL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A.DASHER","source_asin":"B089SZX5QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089SZX5QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089SZX5QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
