window.products.push({"id":696392,"name":"Poly and Bark Rocker Lounge Chair, Fuchsia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e3iqPfCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The iconic Charles e. RAR rocking chair has a timeless appeal with the simplicity and functionality of its design structure. Initially created for the ‘low cost furniture design’ organized by the new York museum of modern art, the impressive chair comprises a smooth one-piece seating shell and a contrasting base of the designer’s emblematic entwined wire rods design. The chair complies with all essentials for comfort, providing a relaxing rocking experience. Poly & bark produces the Eames style RAR rocking chair with a quality and durable matte finish polypropylene plastic seat in a range of vibrant colors. The base is from a reliable wire construction on beech wood runners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e3iqPfCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLY & BARK","source_asin":"B00RZT0VHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RZT0VHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RZT0VHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696393,"name":"Alen FIT50 Air Purifier, Quiet Air Flow for Large Rooms, 900 SqFt, Air Cleaner for Allergens, Dust, Mold, Pet Dander, Heavy Odors with Long Filter Lif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":443.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdlUJrJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Alen BreatheSmart Fit50 is ideal for large and extra-large sized living spaces including living rooms, bedrooms, gyms, nurseries, laundry rooms, guest rooms, bathrooms, offices, kitchens, basements and more! Developed by NASA airflow engineers, the BreatheSmart Fit50 cleans 900 SqFt every 30 minutes. Alen’s True HEPA-PURE filter is best for removing airborne allergens, dust, pollen (produced by trees, flowers, & grasses), pet smells, fur, and household odors. It comes with a Medical Grade H13 True HEPA layer that removes 99.99% bacteria, aerosolized viruses, and airborne particles larger than 0.1 micron. HEPA-PURE is our BASE filter and provides clean fresh air by trapping airborne irritants that cause seasonal allergies and congestion. A Laser Smart Sensor detects airborne particles and self-adjusts to address the challenges of the ever-changing environment. The LED color display has 3 quality color indicators that update in real-time: Blue = Excellent (low levels of particles) Orange = Fair (moderate levels of particles) Red = Poor (high levels of particles). Any room, whether it is a large room like a living room or kitchen or even an apartment, the BreatheSmart Fit50 has an auto setting so you can have clean air all day and night. It comes with an ozone-safe ionizer that aides in cleaning the air, by producing negative ions which attract and clump ultra-fine particles together so the HEPA layer filters can trap the dirty air. Built to be compact, but mighty, the Fit50 is a little under 2 feet tall and 17 inches wide and has a powerful punch to clean air quickly and quietly. It has four fan speed options; the lowest produces a small frequency, like a whisper. On the turbo fan setting the BreatheSmart Fit50 emits a frequency called pink noise which is a lower tone then the white noise and sounds like a gentle rainfall. Includes: 1 BreatheSmart Fit50 Air Purifier, 1 True HEPA-Pure Filter, 1 Panel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdlUJrJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alen","source_asin":"B09MVFJR8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVFJR8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVFJR8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
