window.products.push({"id":696403,"name":"Bamboo Roll Up Window Blind Sun Shade for Indoor Outdoor Patio Garden, Light Filtering Roller Reed Shades with Lifter, 10\" 20\" 24\" 28\" 30\" 32\" 36\" 40\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ngDtR5bcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▲ZZBHD conveys the aesthetics of life design. We put all our energy into product design, combining industrial design, material design, aesthetic design, and grafting art to create products that users can't put down.☞ Customize your home with no customization costs! Using 100% natural wild reed premium material, our goal is to make bamboo roman roller blinds that look great while providing the amount of shade your home needs. Our natural reed and bamboo shades make you dream of being in the tropics, with the soft light and breeze on your face whether you're sitting in the lounge or lying down. The roll-up fasteners can be easily rolled up to any height for a little shade from the sun. You will absolutely love it!☆☆☆☆ SpecificationsProduct name: Bamboo blindsMaterial: Natural reedColour: Carbonised brownFeatures: light filtering, sun protection, shade, UV protection, water resistance, moisture resistance, heat insulation, sturdiness, breathability, ventilation, privacy screenPrinciple of operation: fitted with lift, pull cordSize: You can customize any size except the size provided by the storeApplicable places: living room, reading room, dining room, studio, shop, office, lounge, curtain partition, tea room, cafe, wall decoration, curtain, sunshade[Measurement]:External installation.Curtain width = window width + 10cm (4\")Curtain height = curtain height + 10cm (4\")Internal installation.Curtain width = window width - 1cm (0.4\")Curtain height = window height☟ ☟Notes：✎The dimensions provided by the store are width x height. When the measurement is accurate, you can place an order.✎ Please understand that there may be an error of 1 to 3cm in the product size due to manual measurement✎ Due to the natural material, the reed curtain retains its original texture, so differences in detail are normal✎ If you have any questions, please feel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ngDtR5bcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B5HBXT3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5HBXT3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5HBXT3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696404,"name":"75W Electric Lunch Box Food Heater, 1.8L Large Capacity Heated Lunch Boxes for Adults/Work/Car/Office, 3 in 1 12V/24V/110V Food Warmer Lunch Box with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kQ2N1ovuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Healthy & Warm Meals --- Do you often have to eat cold meals because you are busy? Now, our new electric lunch box food heater will completely change the way you eat. You can simply plug in and the heated lunch box will heat your food to perfection. Whether you're at the office (110V), in the car (12V) or in the truck (24V), you can enjoy a hot, delicious meal to your heart's content. 75W Fast heating / Delicious Food --- Our heated lunch boxes for adults features an upgraded 75W recirculating heating system that heats up faster. Once plugged in, it will heat up in 30-45 minutes. Also, our electric lunch boxes features innovative PTC thermostatic heating technology that heats more evenly to keep food moist and fresh for better taste. Excellent Leak-proof Design --- To make electric lunch box for men seal better, we designed it with 4 snaps and a built-in rubber seal so that soup won't spill out even if the lunchbox is tipped on its side. It's perfect for construction workers, corporate office workers, truck drivers and others who want to carry their own lunch. Large 1.8L Capacity & Abundant Accessories --- The electric lunch box food warmer's large 1.8L capacity can meet the needs of people of any age. Also included is a 0.45L plastic box that can hold different types of food, such as fruit or toppings, providing more options. In addition, the heated lunch box has a lid to store spoons and forks, and you can even use it as a phone stand to watch movies while you eat. Best Gift/Perfect After-sales Service --- We hope that this electric lunch box for car and home is a best gift for your kinsfolk/lover/friends, which can make your life and their life better. If there is any problem with the heatable lunch box, please feel free to contact us. Even if you miss the return window, we will ship you a new lunch box or give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kQ2N1ovuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xflyee","source_asin":"B0C1NMJSC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1NMJSC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1NMJSC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
