window.products.push({"id":696436,"name":"labato Clothes Organizer for Closet, Clothing Drawer Organizers for Folded Clothes, Wardrobe Pants Organizer Tshirt / Leggings Organizer Storage Bins,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hOefs6CTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👕👖 Widely Used : This clothes organizer is great for thin jeans, t-shirts, baby or kids clothes, bras, socks or other items. You can use it for storage in wardrobes, drawers, etc. There are 6, 7, 9 or 11 different kinds of grids to sort and organize your belongings to keep your living space organized. 👕👖 Easy to Clean : The storage box adopts a ventilated design, which is hygienic and clean, which can effectively reduce the odor of clothes and keep the clothes fresh. It is very easy to reuse and clean, you can easily clean with water, it is washable and reusable. 👕👖 Durable Material : This wardrobe clothes organizer is made of mesh nylon, which is very durable and will not deform even if pulled. You don't have to worry about it not fitting your clothes, it's super suitable for many everyday clothes for adults, kids and babies. 👕👖 Easy to Carry : The compact design of the wardrobe clothes organizer allows you to easily carry it between high or low shelves. When you need them, just remove the clothing storage bag from the closet or drawer. 👕👖 Storage Box Size : Each closet organizer can meet various storage needs! The size of the clothes organizer is (7 Grids size: 14.17*9.84*7.87 inch). You can accommodate different clothes and it always meets your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hOefs6CTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"labato","source_asin":"B09SYNL2SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SYNL2SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SYNL2SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696437,"name":"Reusable Silicone Food Preservation Bags, Food Savers, FDA & SGS Food Grade Silicone For Hot Cooking, Freezing, Snack Packing & Sous Vide Cooking. Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-OE73AqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are tired of buying replacement poly food bags and throwing the old ones away, or have had enough of your food tasting like plastic, then we have just the thing for you. The Cooksterz reusable silicone food bag doesn’t need to be thrown away and won’t make your food taste bad either! Its sole purpose in life is to bring ease into your day-to-day living. How does it do this? Read on… FULLY ISOLATED FOOD STORAGE Our hermetically sealed food preservation bags keep everything airtight. This means that the food, drinks, sauces and snacks remain fresh for longer. Want to give your kids a treat for school lunch? The Cooksterz bag will keep the food clean on the inside and the germs on the outside. Lie it flat, or stand upright, whichever way you want but the contents will remain inside. HEAT OR FREEZE THEN STORE IT Pop the food in the bag, drop it into the cooking pot, oven or microwave for sous vide cooking. This product can take the heat of the kitchen, no problem. Want to freeze a dish, got some leftovers you don’t want to waste? Bag it and freeze it, ready for another time. Simple. Job done. EASY TO CLEAN, EASY TO DRY We all know that people are busy. You don’t want your precious time taken up struggling to clean a food bag. No problem. The Cooksterz cooking bag is easy to clean. You can wash it by hand or pop it into a dishwasher and it will come out looking like new. PRODUCT DETAIL 4 Color Pack: White, Red, Green and Blue  Size: Large – 10.8 inches wide by 8.4 inches tall  Can hold up to 50.7 fluid oz. OPENING/CLOSING INSTRUCTIONS Ensure the arrows are lined up before closing / opening. When new, using a little coconut oil or similar can make closing and opening easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-OE73AqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooksterz","source_asin":"B073XW8DF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XW8DF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XW8DF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
