window.products.push({"id":696453,"name":"6Pcs Kratky Lids Wide Mouth Hydroponic Cover Lids, Kratky Mason Jar Lids with 6Pcs Kratky Blackout Sleeves Kratky Lid Insert Hydroponic Lids Kratky Hy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4E7cGrjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Kratky lids are made of high quality acrylic material, sturdy and reusable, fits perfectly in wide mouth mason jars and other jars.Our blackout sleeves are made of high quality 210D polyester,comes with an adjustment buckle, can washable and reusable. Package include: You will get 6pcs mason jar lids with a diameter of 86mm and 6pcs blackout sleeves, the blackout sleeve fit 32oz wide mouth mason jars,which are enough for you to use in daily hydroponic system or replace. Function: Our lids are perfect for mason jars for kratky hydroponics, it is black and blocks most of the light from above into the jar.Our blackout sleeves allow you control light for different sprout seeds. It can keep light out of your container when hydroponic use. Easy to use: With this kratky jar cover, just set it and then watch your plant slowly drink water from the mason jar while enjoying the lush foliage growth.you can only put the mason jar into the blackout sleeve ,then tighten the adjustable buckle.very easy. Wide use: Kratky hydroponics is the most passive form of hydroponics, and hydroponic cover lids and blackout sleeves can help you grow more plants easily!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4E7cGrjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emsiok","source_asin":"B0BY888C1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY888C1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY888C1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696454,"name":"Circulon Classic 8-Quart Nonstick Stockpot with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Amazon.com Classic stockpots are tall and narrow to simmer stocks and broths for long periods with minimal evaporation. This pot is shaped more like a soup pot, with a diameter greater than its height. Compromised somewhat as an ideal stockpot, it offers versatility instead. In the oven (to 350 degrees) or atop the stove and covered with its tight-fitting lid, it functions as a casserole to stew or braise. It's perfect for simmering soup, boiling pasta, or cooking chili. Anodized for hardness and durability, the pot has a concentric-circle grooved cooking surface that prolongs the life of its nonstick coating. (As the grooves' high areas wear down over the years, the low are spared wear and remain nonstick.) To preserve the interior, use only wood or plastic utensils. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circulon","source_asin":"B00004S8EO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004S8EO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004S8EO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
