window.products.push({"id":696521,"name":"Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Fabuletta 6L Top Fill Humidifiers with Remote Control Quiet Rapid Ultrasonic Air Humidifier for Large Room Humidity ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI-vj2afL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Low-Medium-High Mist Mode: Cool Humidifier for Bedroom Large Room Fabuletta meets your customized needs.The large Cool Mist Fabuletta Humidifier can quickly cover 755ft² of the area and lasts up to 60 hours in low mode,provides you with fresh air for more than a day, helping you sleep comfortably without congestion, coughing, or dry mouth. LED Touch Control & Remote Control: Sensitive touch buttons/Remote Control(within 49ft) help you easily customize your favorite mode. Enjoying all day mist and rest easily. Perfect for your baby and a disturbance-free sleep at night. Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier: Safely moisturizes the dry air in your bedroom, living room, nursery, office and so on. To relieve stress and create a comfortable and breathable living atmosphere. 6L Water Tank: The large capacity 6L (1.6 gallon) tank of our ultrasonic humidifier runs for up to 6 nights per fill. Unlike other small capacity humidifiers on the market that require frequent water refilling. 360° Rotating Nozzle & Mist Output in Two Directions: Fabuletta Room Humidifier designed with a 360° rotating nozzle so that you can customize the mist flow direction, you can choose to toward plants which is beneficial to plant growth. Whisper-Quiet Operation: Humidifiers for bedroom with essential oils works almost no noise which offers maximum relaxation during sleeping or working.(less than 24 dB) Easy to refill & Bulit-in Essential Oil Tray: Air Humidifier Fabuletta pour water directly from the top opening, do not add water through the mist tube, or the inner chamber. A better fit for the user's usage scenario, add 8-12 drops of your favorite essential oils to the tray to create a fragrant home spa when you are putting on a mask. Perfect for the night time: Sleep mode of humidifiers for baby Fabuletta is that combines multiple functions into one button according to people's usage habits. It will turn off the display lights for you and run at the quietest level. It won’t bother you at night with beeping or bright lights.The humidifier features a night light which can be used when drinking water at night. Auto Shut-Off: The automatic shut-off feature of top fill humidifier Fabutletta turns the humidifier off when the water level is low. Rest assured you can set it and forget it! Peace Your Mind & Life Partner: Fabuletta Humidifiers Powerful mist output with high/medium/low settings makes this humidifier ideal coverage for bedrooms, living rooms, nurseries, offices,s and indoor plants. Also perfect for yoga, masking, learning, and interacting with children scenarios.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI-vj2afL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FABULETTA","source_asin":"B0BX487KHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX487KHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX487KHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
