window.products.push({"id":696575,"name":"Wireless Meat Thermometer, NEXTAMZ Digital Meat Thermometer for Food Cooking and Baking, Dual Probe Food Thermometer for Oven BBQ Grill Smoker Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AhVbPRXvL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【328ft Stable Signal & Hands-Free Monitor】 NEXTAMZ wireless meat thermometer with dual probes can monitor the temperature of food or oven/grill/smoker through a strong and stable signal connection, far to 328ft indoor/490ft outdoor. You can play with your family, pets, or watch a football/basketball game, while the wireless thermometer is staring at the temperature of your food, and the food thermometer will beep and flash to remind you after it is cooked. 【Easy To Use】 No need to synchronize, say goodbye to complicated setup steps. The transmitter and receiver have been paired in the manufacturing plant, just plug in the battery and the meat thermometer probe, and you can use the meat thermometer! There are hook and stand on the back of the meater thermometer wireless, you can put the meat thermometer on the table, or hang the transmitter on the oven and hang the receiver on your pocket. 【Kitchen Timer And Alarm】 Set your desired food temperature or time for the grill or smoker. This instant read meat thermometer will flash and beep to remind you once it reaches the preset temperature or time (count up or countdown ). The large LCD backlight screen allows you to read clearly in dim light conditions. 【USDA Preset Temperature Setting】 It is a professional digital meat thermometer for oven/wireless thermometer for smoking. This oven thermometer has preset temperatures for 8 types of meat and various doneness levels recommended by the USDA; all preset temperatures can be reset to your desired taste. 【Accurate And Durable Probe】 The NEXTAMZ cooking thermometer has two probes with a decompression tip design, which are easier to insert or pull out to obtain the temperature more accurately and quickly reading within 1-3 seconds. The probe is made of food-grade stainless steel, water-proof and heat-resistant materials can extend the using life. The large LCD display shows the temperature of the food and the oven at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AhVbPRXvL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEXTAMZ","source_asin":"B0BNN9FFNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNN9FFNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNN9FFNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696576,"name":"CASA COPENHAGEN Designed in Denmark 550 GSM 2 Large Bath Towels 2 Large Hand Towels 2 Washcloths, Super Soft Egyptian Cotton 6 Towels Set for Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b8yAURtwL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"INGREDIENT: Set contains 2 Large Bath Towels of 27x55 Inches, 2 Large Hand Towels of 16x28 Inches, 2 Washcloths of 12x12 Inches. MATERIAL: Made of 100% cotton fabric and terry in nature provides excellent absorbency quality. TEXTURE: Our Towels are 550 GSM, made from natural materials and free from harmful chemicals or synthetic materials which is safe for you and your family. Available in Six beautiful colours combinations to go with the décor of your home, spa, or gym. FUNCTION: Highly absorbent, yet light-weighted. Gives the body a soft, plush and fluffy feel while absorbing the moisture. CARE TIPS: The Towels are machine washable. Wash the towels in cold water before use. This will cause the cotton fibres to open up and give the towels better absorbency. Always wash towels separately from all other items of clothing to decrease transfer of towel lint to other clothing. Hang them up afterward in an area with good air or in direct sunlight. Do not use an iron on these towels. Do not use fabric softener or bleach as they decrease the life, softness and fluffiness of your towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b8yAURtwL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA COPENHAGEN","source_asin":"B0C4B3F732","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4B3F732","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4B3F732","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
