window.products.push({"id":696725,"name":"Tangy Key Lime Pie 100% Soy 10oz Candle Fruit Pastry Baked Goods Scented Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ocMPoDpKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As soon as you open this candle, you can just feel your fork sliding sideways down through the most succulent piece of Key Lime Pie you've ever tasted. We've actually taken that \"tangy\" sensation you feel when eating the classic lime dessert and turned it into a smell! Hints of cream, hot pie crust, and a fresh batch of ripe limes are sure to bring a smile to your face. As with all of our candle products, \"Tangy Key Lime Pie\" is made with domestically-sourced natural soy wax, custom-mixed fragrances from the state of Georgia, and are all hand-poured in beautiful South Alabama. You're sure to enjoy this southern delicacy for a very long time due to our \"48+ hour burn time\" wax formula. The Pea River Candle Company was started by a close-knit family of candle makers with a passion for bringing the art of quality candle-making to the USA while providing highly desirable jobs to rural America. Established in the beautiful historic town of Elba, Alabama, our company drew its' name from the 154-mile long river that runs through the town. PRCC founders purchased and restored a 1940's historic building, and all Pea River Products are created there to this day! From day one, our candle masters have used green sourcing practices and local suppliers. Our \"World's Best Smelling Candles\" use 100% natural soy wax & custom-mixed fragrances. The majority of our fragrances are conceived by the candle masters at Pea River Candle and then formulated with the collaboration of a family-owned fragrance company in the state of Georgia. Final product development occurs at our production facility in Southeast Alabama. Pea River Candles make Great Gift Ideas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ocMPoDpKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pea River Candle Company","source_asin":"B0BB3SJBM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB3SJBM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB3SJBM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
