window.products.push({"id":696774,"name":"Finnhomy 42L Extra Large Utility Tote Bag, Oxford Fabric Reusable Folding Grocery Bags with Handles and Pockets, 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eD7yDhPyS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Oxford Fabric Imported Nylon lining Zipper closure Machine Wash 1. EXTRA LARGE -This oversized tote bag is about 22''x12''x10'' when fully opened and two durable sturdy handles make it easy for carry with heavy goods. The tote bag provides ample shopping and storage space (11.5 Gallons). Two exterior side pockets extend your storage space and can help you realize small items organization needs. In addition, we also have an inside pocket with zipper which allow you to put personal items like keys, cell phone, cards etc. and make them safe. 2. PREMIUM QUALITY FABIRC – This reusable tote bag is made of durable 300D oxford fabric with PVC coating material which provides an excellent waterproof performance, the inside layer is made of 210D Lining Nylon. You may use a wet towel to clean the grocery bags easily if necessary for your next grocery run. 3. MULTI-PURPOSE TOTE BAG -It’s a perfect carry-all big tote bag with open top. You can use it as a shopping grocery bag, beach tote, picnic bag, laundry bag, gym bag, utility tote bag or even an extra storage bin. This tote bag can not only save you space but also money! 4. EASY TO CARRY AND FOLD FLAT, WITHOUT METAL WIRE - Two straps with Velcro on top allow handles to stay together and make it easier and more comfortable for carry. Soft and folding design (without steel wire) help you store it anywhere you like for next use! The bag can be folded into a small size like an iPhone 12 Pro Max for easy storage when it is not in use. When folded, you can easily put it into your car storage space or into a closet drawer without taking up much space. 5.  FASHIONABLE 4 COLORS TO CHOOSE Berry Red is just like a glass of red wine. It is not strong red, but composed and low-key with connotation. Charcoal Black is not monotonous black. It's more like a midnight sky, black and bright, and you'll love it. Winter Grey may be the most classic color. A casual yet business color, it can be matched with any outfit you wear. Denim Blue is our new color. This color brings you relaxation and peacefulness, both suitable for men and women.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eD7yDhPyS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Finnhomy","source_asin":"B0B1DT42MP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DT42MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DT42MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696775,"name":"Kentucky Derby by Master's Art, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tH5WsImyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a horse race at the Kentucky Derby. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the sould of the world, that it represents our human essence.MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters FineArt carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic.Above all it is beautiful and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece.The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame.This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tH5WsImyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BWK9MQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWK9MQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWK9MQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
