window.products.push({"id":696918,"name":"BeeGreen 3 Pack Burlap Tote Bags Bulk w Inner Zipper Pocket & Handles Laminated Interior W16.5“×H13”×D7.25“ X-Large Jute Gift Tote Beach Bag for Mothe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91io7fsOQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY:W16.5“×H13”×D7.25“,our burlap tote bag can hold everything you need for a day. There is plenty of space to securely store clothing, towels, food, sunscreen, smartphone, cosmetics, magazines, etc. Widened bottom and sides help to hold more while keeping in good shape perfect for beach, party, shopping, traveling or other daily use. DURABLE AND COMFORTABLE USAGE: Thickened jute(350gsm thickness) makes this tote bag stronger, and there is a zippered pocket inside, which can hold personal belonging, such as bank cards, keys, ID cards. Burlap tote bags are made from natural jute burlap,The natural cotton handles are soft and comfortable for extended use. The large tote bag can easily be worn on the shoulder and all sizes are easy to carry by hand: long shoulder straps fit your shoulder comfort. NATURAL & REUSABLE - Help SAVE the environment by reducing the need for paper and plastic bags. burlap gift bags are a great reusable option that doesn't create any waste.You can also use the jute tote bag as a gift for your wife, girlfriend, good friend, colleague and your daughter. INTERNAL LAMINATION COATING: These Promotional Jute Burlap Tote Bags are made of 100% natural jute/burlap fiber with interior laminated coating.It helps the bag stand up well and keeps your stuffs from rainning. and the clothes in the bag will not get dirty or wet when you go swimming or on the beach. WIDE APPLICATION: Jute Tote Bags are perfect for grocery shopping, travel, beach, pool visits, work, church, which is big enough to hold everything you need, free your hands. Also Perfect for custom DIY, like heat transfer, tie dye, screen printing, sublimation printing, art and crafts, to customize personalized bags as bridesmaid bags, gifts for mother, teacher, friends and employees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91io7fsOQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B09CD4P6QP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD4P6QP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD4P6QP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
