window.products.push({"id":696943,"name":"Rae Dunn K Cup Holder - Coffee Pod Holder K Cup Organizer - Small Sliding Drawer Storage Tray Saves Kitchen Counter Space - KCup Holder Coffee Pod Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hwjCAeW5L._AC_SL1121_.jpg","description":"As any java junkie can attest, you like your coffee fresh, but you don’t like the mess that comes with it. This stylishly functional K-Cup compatible holder from Rae Dunn helps to keep your countertops tidy by giving all your coffee pods a place to live until it’s time to brew. With recessed pockets to store up to 30 coffee pods, it’s easy to organize your coffee pods by flavor or roast type, making choosing your morning coffee a breeze!PRODUCT FEATURES:Coffee Pod OrganizerHolds 30 Coffee PodsSliding Drawer StorageCompatible with K cupsDimensions: 12” x 12.5” x 2.75”SAVE TIME IN THE MORNINGBrewing your morning coffee doesn’t have to be a frantic effort of tearing through drawers, slamming cabinets, and rifling noisily through your kitchen for what you need, just before jetting out the door hoping you haven’t forgotten something! With the Rae Dunn K-Cup Compatible Holder, everything you need to make your favorite coffee pods is perfectly organized and always leaves you with extra time to spare.CUT DOWN COUNTER CLUTTERIf you're a fan of K-Cups, then you'll love the convenience of a K-Cup compatible Holder to prevent a pile-up of coffee pods on the counter. This classy organizer holds up to 30 K-Cups, so you can always have your favorite coffee on hand. The smooth sliding drawer is silent to open, with 5 rows of storage 6 pods deep.RAE DUNN California artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hwjCAeW5L._AC_SL1121_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B0BL9MQ2R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9MQ2R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9MQ2R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
