window.products.push({"id":696954,"name":"Upgraded Hat Hook for Wall,New Hat Racks for Baseball Caps,Cowboy Hat Rack Holder Organizer,Easy to Install, Multi-functional Hat Organizer (black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vWDyK3h5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABS 【Upgrade Three Hooks】Our hat hook has two more hanging points than the general baseball cap rack with a new design, you can hang hats and pendants and other jewelry at the same time, and easily manage your fashion matching. 【DURABLE AND STRONG】The wall hat rack uses strong adhesive and can hold up to 3 lbs. We use strong adhesives to ensure your hooks stay in place. No need to drill holes in the wall, no professional tools, no nails. It is recommended to clean the wall before sticking, and then stick it. 【Prevent Hat from Deformation】Our wall hat holder has an arc design to ensure that your hat will not be damaged. It doesn't distort the shape of a pretty hat like a normal wall hat hook. Compatible with any other modern design home decor, the hat is mostly hidden behind when hanging. Use the multiple invisible baseball cap organizers to perfectly organize and display your hats, as well as a stylish wall decoration. 【Room Decoration】Arrange hooks to display stylish hats according to your preference. Wall-mounted hat holders are suitable for many places, such as door, wall, closet, bedroom, bathroom, doorway, office, store, etc.; they also fit most hats, including baseball caps, fitted hats, sun hats, flat brim hats, etc., hats The hanger can also be used as a headphone hanger and other household items under 3 lbs. 【WHAT YOU WILL GET】Black baseball cap wall holder has a total of 10 pieces, and the quantity is large, we have packed an unexpected gift, hope you like it, please contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vWDyK3h5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"najoane","source_asin":"B0B5HGSF73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5HGSF73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5HGSF73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":696955,"name":"Wacaco Nanopresso Portable Espresso Maker bundled with Protective Case, Tattoo Jungle Patrol Edition, Extra Small Travel Coffee Maker, Manually Operat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MyCHPnKRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[LIMITED EDITION] The Nanopresso Red Tattoo Jungle is a Limited Edition. A one time production, specially designed by our in-house designer. The Nanopresso main body has been covered with dense vegetation doodles art, while a red accent has been given to the Nanopresso Case to perfectly match with the portable espresso machine. The result is a beautiful and very unique bundle, available in limited quantity. [MASSIVE POWER] Built around a newly patented pumping system, the Nanopresso is capable of reaching, with the help of your hands, a maximum of 18 bars (261 PSI) of stable pressure during extraction for unparalleled coffee quality. It is more than what most home espresso machines can deliver. [EASIER THAN EVER] The Nanopresso works best with finely ground coffee that is tamped hard. It is delightfully easy to operate and simple to use. The Nanopresso requires 15% less force to pump compared to previous models. With Nanopresso, the power is in the machine, not in your hands. [SMALLEST AND LIGHTEST] Nanopresso’s ergonomic design and shorter length makes it your travel companion of choice. Nanopresso is engineered to be extremely light. Yet, designed to go wherever you go, its construction delivers a reassuringly solid feel. Overall length is 6.14 in / 15.6 cm and the weight is at just 0.74 lb /336 g. [GREAT ADD ON] You can buy Nanopresso NS Adapter or Nanopresso Barista Kit accessories separately in order to use Nespresso** Original capsules and most of compatibles or make double espresso shots. Add Nanopresso NS Adapter from (B076DGY1NS). Add Nanopresso Barista Kit from (B078GM6FFH). Versatility is where the Nanopresso shines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MyCHPnKRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WACACO","source_asin":"B07HRDYDGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-696955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HRDYDGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HRDYDGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
